social-imagery-directions.html

# Photography held out of the repo until #327 records its provenance.
#
# This repo is public, so committing an image here publishes it — which is
# the same act the provenance policy governs. The Track D artboard
# references nile-rodgers-2026.jpg by filename and the published canvas
# carries its own private copy, so the mock renders for review either way;
# a fresh clone shows a broken image until the file is dropped back in.
#
# Remove this rule once #327 confirms the photo is ours to publish.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
